# ★ The Docker build context is the working directory, not the git index.
# .gitignore has no effect here, so without this file `COPY . .` bakes the
# untracked .env (and .git, and 600 MB of recording material) into the image.
# Allowlist the runtime surface instead of denylisting secrets: a file added
# to the working tree tomorrow cannot ride along by default.
*
!package.json
!demo/
!src/
!paypal/
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Belt and braces: never ship local secrets, VCS data, or developer material.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
node_modules/
_take/
devpost-media/
devpost-video/
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
*.mp3
